      "id": "n001-text",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# CS1 Semester Topic Map\nGenerated view \u2014 reproducible from `docs/curriculum/`, `planning/`, `lessons/`, and `assignments/`. Re-run `scripts/views/generate_semester_topic_map.py` to refresh; never hand-edit. Lives in `views/` (not `.views/`) so Obsidian's file explorer, which hides dot-prefixed folders by default, can actually show it.\n\nArranged left-to-right by the real Fall 2026 week sequence, grouped by Coding Odyssey arc. Arrows carry the *why* \u2014 what concept the next step actually depends on, not just file adjacency.",
