    {
      "id": "n040-text",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Documentation drift (flagged, not fixed):**\n`planning/week-09.md` (committed 2026-10-08) explicitly says it *supersedes* the Week 9 framing in `planning/block-map.md` and `planning/coding-odyssey-arc-map.md` (both committed 2026-08-12), and says in its own text: 'Remapping Week 10 and later is a separate mission.' That remap has not happened yet \u2014 the arc-map/block-map still describe Week 9 as 'strings continued' with no class content. Source of truth for Week 9 right now is `week-09.md`; the arc map is stale on this one point.",
